<title>FRANCE: Alliance Via 1996 net attrib profit 141 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Alliance Via 1996 net attrib profit 141 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable		    profit 141  vs	loss 335</p>
<p>    Turnover				     8,911  vs	   9,722</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>     Life					  3,013  vs	   3,317</p>
<p>     Non-life				    5,898  vs	   6,405</p>
<p>NOTE - Alliance said in a statment the 8.3 percent decline in sales in 1996 was the result of a deliberate policy to cut some activities, such as material damage insurance in France's overseas territories, and to reduce others, such as construction insurance.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
